  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "1. Stretching\n   Appears to be moving straight forwards on bones with gravity. When disabling the script to toggle dynamics, it will remain stretched when re-enabled until grabbed once more.\n 2. Grabbing\n   Some bones with and without gravity have weird interactions and behaviors when grabbed, jittering and stuttering and not following grab directions appropriately. (My guess is it might be related to Animated property?)\n 3. Animations\n    The parameters of the physbone scripts do not respond to any changes via animation, even if enabling the Animated mode. They still change when manipulated in the editor, but in the teasers it was promised that these parameters would be animateable unlike those of Dynamic Bones scripts.",
